<title>POLAND: BFK revises up 1996 net profit forecast.</title>
<headline>BFK revises up 1996 net profit forecast.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish cable maker Bydgoska Fabryka Kabli SA (BFK) revised up its 1996 net-profit forecast to 25.6 million zlotys from the earlier expected 20.1 million, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>BFK had a net profit of 11.61 million zlotys last year.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
